{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic local platform fighter where even the worst player can win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world turned into a massive junkyard after humans disappeared, vermin have taken over. Rats, seagulls and other pests clash in an absurd monarchy for one thing only: to sit on the throne!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Royal Vermin is a 2 to 4 player local fighting game inspired by the best platform fighters, featuring ranged combat, chargeable projectiles and constantly unbalanced arenas. Every match is fast, unpredictable and always different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Online play is not officially supported.  </strong>  <br><strong>However, you can play remotely using <u>Steam Remote Play Together</u>.<br>At least 2 players are required to play.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 TO 4 PLAYER LOCAL GAME:</strong> Perfect for game nights with friends and same-screen play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660580/extras/882436338af2ddf3d8013d5329e69d86.poster.avif?t=1772725524\" width=1170 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660580/extras/882436338af2ddf3d8013d5329e69d86.webm?t=1772725524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660580/extras/882436338af2ddf3d8013d5329e69d86.mp4?t=1772725524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SIMPLE AND ACCESSIBLE CONTROLS:</strong> Easy to pick up, even for new players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinl