tch tight until the end and make you want to play just one more round.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Our First King!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3660580/48acd1e4d8e6338a62f5f2b9891c72bd59e6c82e.jpg"},{"name":"Communism","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3660580/1a19831c9b66683f019bef189a40365362ecd6c0.jpg"},{"name":"Did They Just Talk?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3660580/226d68f73d8ae8a823a491b22a8602a03e2d670f.jpg"},{"name":"Is This Heaven?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3660580/0b463327c083d3553d871c550250d7bee01629ee.jpg"},{"name":"Speedrunner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3660580/c0b56c1a19fa6021a5a1ae43817d10b15d578109.jpg"},{"name":"Dominator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3660580/065c56daf9a46a7e9067a1b91290715784641365.jpg"},{"name":"CHAD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3660580/1439318017fa515a364a34947c4b459b24102c2f.jpg"},{"name":"Expert Mode!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3660580/5968cc63e9bb02003ef177fee61dbcc2188d92f6.jpg"},{"name":"Will We Ever Find Peace?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3660580/ac50d161017e014c5808033bd64da33b3c067857.jpg"},{"name":"We Should Start a Democracy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3660580/0ce7beb631824ba33249e59f2bdd6f449e827df2.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3660580?t=1772725524","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660580/9ac5fe57a0f569ee18c85d375f01d60259567cd3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772725524","capsule_image":"https://shared.akama